'''Arcanine ex''' (Japanese: '''ウインディex''' ''Windie ex'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

