==Trivia==
When starting the game, if a player chooses a {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}}: Pikachu pack to open as their first pack, it will always contain the double rare version of this card.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Arcanine}}.
*'''Inferno Onrush''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Arcanine|22}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.

